# The exact denial each document in hospedajedonlolo-readiness-and-tables.yaml
# must produce. Removing hospedajedonlolo-com from restricted_role_namespaces,
# workload_release_names or site_chart_sources silences its line here, and the
# readiness rule must hold in both directions.
Role hospedajedonlolo-com/site-exec must not grant direct pods/exec workload control outside the exact Helm readiness read-back
HelmRelease hospedajedonlolo-com/other-release must use canonical releaseName
HelmRelease identity hospedajedonlolo-com/other-release must be canonical
OCIRepository hospedajedonlolo-com/other-chart must use canonical identity hospedajedonlolo-com-chart
HelmRelease hospedajedonlolo-com values must contain exactly deploymentReady: false
HelmRelease naranjo-online values must contain exactly deploymentReady: true
